{
  "compilerOptions": {
    "composite": true,
    "skipLibCheck": true,
    "module": "ESNext",
    "moduleResolution": "bundler",
    "allowSyntheticDefaultImports": true,
    /*
     * 产物必须落到别处，不能落在这些配置旁边。
     *
     * `composite: true` 蕴含 `declaration: true`，所以这个程序**天生会 emit**，而
     * `noEmit` 只写在 `package.json` 的命令行上（`tsc -p tsconfig.node.json --noEmit`）。
     * 于是任何一次不带那个开关的调用（裸 `npx tsc -p tsconfig.node.json`、`tsc -b`）都会
     * 在 `frontend/` 根上吐出 `tailwind.config.js` / `vite.config.js` 各一份加 `.d.ts`。
     * Tailwind 解析配置时 `tailwind.config.js` 排在 `tailwind.config.ts` 前面，一旦
     * 这份 `.js` 快照落地，`.ts` 里的修改既不报错也不生效。`outDir` 让它们改落到
     * `node_modules` 里的临时目录 —— 那里不参与任何解析顺序。
     */
    "outDir": "./node_modules/.tmp/tsconfig-node"
  },
  // Everything that runs on node rather than in the browser — the tooling
  // configs and the Playwright specs. `references` from tsconfig.json does
  // not check these outside `tsc -b`, so they all belong in this one program:
  // checking only vite.config.ts would leave exactly the blind spot this
  // program exists to close, and an e2e spec that nothing type-checks is a
  // spec that can reference a removed selector helper and still look fine
  // until CI runs a browser.
  "include": [
    "vite.config.ts",
    "vitest.config.ts",
    "playwright.config.ts",
    "tailwind.config.ts",
    "e2e/**/*.ts"
  ]
} 